Package: bionemor
Title: Use BioNeMo Recipes Evo 2 from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tomasz", "Kalinowski", , "kalinowskit@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Run generation, sequence scoring, positional profiles,
    embeddings, checkpoint conversion and export, data preparation, and
    fine-tuning for Evo 2 through NVIDIA BioNeMo Recipes. Model operations
    require a CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU; there is no CPU fallback. Commands run
    in external local or container processes and return portable R results.
    Slurm support is experimental.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor
BugReports: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor/issues
OS_type: unix
SystemRequirements: Linux, CUDA-capable NVIDIA GPU, Docker with NVIDIA
    Container Toolkit (for the package-managed container runtime)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    generics,
    jsonlite,
    processx,
    ps,
    S7 (>= 0.2.0),
    stats,
    utils,
    yaml12 (>= 0.1.0)
Suggests:
    Biostrings,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
